roy them.  Carry your heads high, you are a soldier in the 104th Anti-Tank Brigade!',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',286,286,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','frarmfor',1,'SYSTEM'),(942,932,168,1,3,1050010,'605rp','605e Régiment de Pionniers','605.Régiment','Default Brigade Motto','urdead1: urdead1: urdead1: 605 is glad to see you in game. Please check in on brigade ch.Good luck and most of all have fun. Check us out at http://169thsog.guildportal.com or htt://10mdiv.wwll.online.org\n',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',286,286,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','frgrdfor',1,'SYSTEM'),(943,933,168,1,3,1196437,'4blm','4e Brigade Légère Mécanique (Armored)','4.Brigade','Default Brigade Motto','ibram: Lets kick some axis butt  and keep our FBs allied\n',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',327,327,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','frarmfor',1,'SYSTEM'),(944,933,168,1,3,1329109,'8dc','8e Régiment de Cuirassiers','8.Régiment','Default Brigade Motto','tanaka: tanaka: HELLO TO EVERYBODY\nENJOY IN GAME\n\nTEAM WORK NEEDED\n',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',327,327,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','frgrdfor',1,'SYSTEM'),(950,0,165,1,1,77237,'bef','British Expeditionary Force','bef','','',NULL,'2011-06-27 17:03:28',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'',1,'SYSTEM'),(951,950,166,1,1,1025285,'icorps','Ist Corps','icorps','Default Brigade Motto','Brigade Message of the Day',NULL,'2008-09-22 21:13:07',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'',1,'SYSTEM'),(953,951,167,1,1,49567,'2id','2nd Infantry Division','2.Division','Default Brigade Motto','Brigade Message of the Day',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',320,320,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukhqfor',1,'SYSTEM'),(954,951,167,1,1,1126548,'1id','1st Infantry Division','1.Division','Default Brigade Motto','Brigade Message of the Day',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',279,279,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukhqfor',1,'SYSTEM'),(957,953,168,1,1,73099,'2ab','2nd Armoured Brigade (Armoured)','2.Brigade','Default Brigade Motto','bondpaul: Please welcome the new 2nd Armoured CO,Brigadier Chimpiee!\n2nd Armoured is back up and running again!please stay tuned to the Forums for planned ops.23 is now monitored!\n\nColonel Dalenott is the current brigade Executive Officer.\n\n\nS!\n',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',320,320,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukarmfor',1,'SYSTEM'),(958,953,168,1,1,1314533,'4ib','4th Infantry Brigade','4.Brigade','Default Brigade Motto','sepa: Campaign #72 Stats Tuesday !',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',320,320,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukgrdfor',1,'SYSTEM'),(959,953,168,1,1,1060055,'5ib','5th Infantry Brigade','5.Brigade','Default Brigade Motto','bluekill: ruckrova: ruckrova:  Welcome to 5th Brigade. \n5th Brigade Tune channel 22,\nReport on  20 to  2nd Infantry Division and to  communicate with  other Brigades. ',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',320,320,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukgrdfor',1,'SYSTEM'),(960,954,168,1,1,32896,'sas','Special Air Service','Special Air Service','Default Brigade Motto','bluekill: Welcome to the Special Air Service Command!\n\nBritish Army is always recruiting!Check the 4IB message of the day.\n\nFor training on anything feel free to email me a bebluekill@gmail.com',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',249,279,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukgrdfor',1,'SYSTEM'),(961,954,168,1,1,97099,'1gb','1st Guards Brigade (Armoured)','1.Guards','Default Brigade Motto','thrance: Welcome to 1st Guards Armored Brigade Command!\n',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',279,279,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukarmfor',1,'SYSTEM'),(962,954,168,1,1,1051407,'3ib','3rd Commandos','3.Commandos','Default Brigade Motto','victor242: The 3 Commando Brigade is a unit of the British Royal Marines.  We have a great tradition in game and being cyber Marines, we fight harder and with more tenacity',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',279,279,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukgrdfor',1,'SYSTEM'),(969,0,165,2,1,32161,'raf','British Air Forces France','raf','Default Brigade Motto','Brigade Message of the Day',NULL,'2008-09-22 21:13:07',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'',2,'SYSTEM'),(970,969,166,2,1,9626,'14g','14 Group','14g','Default Brigade Motto','Brigade Message of the Day',NULL,'2008-09-22 21:13:07',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'',2,'SYSTEM'),(971,970,167,2,1,1299652,'60fw','60 Fighter Wing','60.Wing','Default Brigade Motto','Brigade Message of the Day',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',593,593,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukairfor',2,'SYSTEM'),(972,971,168,2,1,1379789,'60w','60 Squadron','60.Squadron','Default Brigade Motto','public001: \nFight to keep our skies clean of Jerries, and occasionally kill a tank!\n',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',320,593,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukairfor',2,'SYSTEM'),(973,971,168,2,1,1047379,'61w','61 Squadron','61.Squadron','Default Brigade Motto','sebesta: S! And welcome to 61 Squadron!  Flying with a wingman will drastically increase your chances of survival.  Teamwork and communication are key.  Clear each other\'s 6\'s and we\'ll all make it home safely.  And remember, SOP for taking down HE-111\'s especially in earlier teirs is to aim for the left wing root, right at the fuel tanks.  \n',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',593,593,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukairfor',2,'SYSTEM'),(974,970,167,2,1,87569,'70bw','70 Bomber Wing','70.Wing','Default Brigade Motto','Brigade Message of the Day',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',593,593,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukbomfor',2,'SYSTEM'),(975,974,168,2,1,1336617,'75w','75 Squadron (CAS Brigade)','75.Squadron','Default Brigade Motto','ratware: S! RAF. Interested in Level Bombing? Contact an allied air officer ingame and we will be happy to show you how to deliver that valuable cargo on time and on target.\n\nHave a Great Day!\n\n\nWant the Greatest advantage ingame join TS2!\nAllied TS info: 66.28.224.194:8767',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',593,593,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukbomfor',2,'SYSTEM'),(976,974,168,2,1,1178059,'76w','76 Squadron (CAS Brigade)','76.Squadron','Default Brigade Motto','laombra: A new campaign is up! So hop in the pride of English engineering and provide the much needed support for our troops on the front line! \n\n\n',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:37',593,593,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukbomfor',2,'SYSTEM'),(978,974,168,2,1,43356,'70w','70 Squadron (Bomber Brigade)','70.Squadron','Default Brigade Motto','apexx: S! Welcome to 70 Squadron. We were BORN to bomb Axis!! New Map Gentlemen and new brigade rules and controls. Your HC staff is working to understand and coordinate to maximize your play and effectiveness. Any suggestions, tips, comments or otherwise always welcome!',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:38',593,593,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukbomfor',2,'SYSTEM'),(979,974,168,2,1,1223645,'52w','52 Squadron (Bomber Brigade)','52.Squadron','Default Brigade Motto','tigger6: Communication wins the day! Report enemy presence, if in trouble ask for help, use TeamSpeak. Tune channel 55.\n',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:38',593,593,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukbomfor',2,'SYSTEM'),(980,0,165,3,1,1040695,'admin','Admiralty','admin','Default Brigade Motto','Brigade Message of the Day',NULL,'2008-09-22 21:13:07',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'',3,'SYSTEM'),(981,980,166,3,1,1051235,'nore','Nore Command','nore','Default Brigade Motto','Brigade Message of the Day',NULL,'2008-09-22 21:13:07',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'',3,'SYSTEM'),(982,981,167,3,1,1085762,'19df','19 Destroyer Flotilla','19.Flotilla','Default Brigade Motto','Brigade Message of the Day',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:38',513,513,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukseafor',3,'SYSTEM'),(983,982,168,3,1,15732,'37ds','37 Destroyer Squadron','37.Squadron','Default Brigade Motto','redeye1:    Make Sure to tune ch 30 for Naval reports! \n Remember to Keep Sinking Them S! ',NULL,'2016-11-11 03:37:38',513,513,0,NULL,1478835457,'1969-12-31 16:00:00','ukseafor',3,'SYSTEM'),(984,982,168,3,1,32896,'38ds','38 Destroyer Squadron','38.Squadron','Def