INSERT INTO `wwii_squads` VALUES (16,'Troisième Division Légère Motorisée','3dlm','La 3DLM est LE squad Francophone, pour tous les nouveaux ,un système de parrainage est mis en place pour les aider. \n\nPar la suite, après la fin de l\'Academie et la réussite des tests, le joueur peut rejoindre une des 4 unitées du squad.','','http://www.3dlm.info/',1,1,0,'2001-06-05 06:05:54','2012-04-15 02:12:21',9432,2,0,0,0,0,'POUR LES NOUVEAUX :\nInscription obligatoire sur  le site www.3dlm.info, cliquez sur \"Nous rejoindre\" et inscription sur le forum avec le même pseudo. Bienvenue à la 3e DLM ;)\n\nCOTE JOUE :\nNous jouons ALLIE !!!\nCommunications :\n- Canaux Textes : Squad + Canal 63 + OPS\n- Canaux TS3 :  66.28.224.195:8767 Mot de Passe : huv36   - Canal \"Squad - 3DLM\"\n',7,'2012-04-14 14:12:21','dannybla',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'3,21,1','Bonjour, nous sommes un squad francophone et jouons surtout en equipe'),(26,'116. Panzerdivision \"Windhund\"','windhund','The 116th Panzerdivision \"Windhund\" (Greyhound) is a combined arms division with members from all over the world. Many of our members are ex-Military. The Windhund was originally formed back in November 1999 by a smelly held.','','http://www.windhund.biz/',1,1,0,'2001-06-05 08:48:29','2012-06-11 06:31:05',15617,0,0,0,0,0,'S! Windhund!  We are taking part in the WW2Oline Host Squad event.  Stay motivated and stick together and ask as many questions as possible.  Join us on TS3 is 66.28.224.195:8768 pass=17x12.  \n\n1. NEW RECRUITS MUST REGISTER @ WWW.WINDHUND.BIZ\nALL NEW RECRUITS HAVE 30 DAYS TO REGISTER\n 2. Squad Ops are Sun @ 1300 CST and Weds All Day',7,'2012-06-10 18:31:05','zzteozz',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,14,-1','Delivering death since 1999'),(56,'31st Wrecking Crew','31stwc','Welcome to  the 31st Wrecking Crew. \nSquad commander: \nFounding fathers: ZZ, Plastic\n\nVisit the forums regularly at http://www.31stwc.com\n','','http://www.31stwc.com',1,1,0,'2001-06-05 11:46:00','2011-12-24 14:53:48',20573,0,0,0,0,0,'Congrats ZZ on the closing of your new home! \n\nHappy Holidays to all the 31st Brotherhood.\n\n\n',7,'2011-12-24 00:53:48','drakkah',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2,19,5','31st Wrecking Crew, \"We\'ll make you famous!\"'),(59,'The Smoking Wrecks','sw','We\'re equal opportunity employers of dweebs. And we\'re back!','','sw.wwiionline.org',1,1,0,'2001-06-05 12:10:32','2007-04-20 03:12:34',2762,0,0,0,0,0,'Squad members of Recruiter and above can change the Squad MOTD via the Squad Tab.\nSquad Leaders can enable or disable squad voting: /voting on|off\nIf your Squad Leader is inactive you can elect a new leader: /voteco callsign\nTo invite a new player to the squad: /recruit callsign',7,NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(72,'Eagle Squadrons/4th Fighter Group','4th_fg','The USAAF\'s highest-scoring Fighter Group.  Modeled currently within the RAF because the 71, 121, and 133 Eagle Squadrons were the Yanks that formed the 4th FG.\nCurrently on hiatus. Email: riotqontrol@gmail.com or rich at gillin dot us\n','','http://dbforums.debdenboys.com',1,0,0,'2001-06-05 13:42:32','2011-12-03 08:25:43',38408,0,0,0,0,0,'20 Nov. 2011 Beachhead Event - manhi (Man High)\nThe event is over, Enjoyed meeting up with long lost wingmates.\nStay in touch: riotqontrol@gmail.com. Meet us at our Facebook page or Google +.\n',7,'2011-11-25 15:45:01','mohawkk',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0','ES/4thFG is not recruiting at this time while there isn\'t any leadership.'),(118,'Australian and New Zealand Army Corps','anzac','The WWIIOL ANZACS are a combined Ground, Air and Naval unit who use Teamspeak as our primary communications tool.  A half social-game unit that is one of the original units formed in WWIIOL.','','http://www.anzacsquad.com',1,1,0,'2001-06-06 03:56:51','2012-06-11 18:03:08',5144,0,0,0,0,0,'\n',7,'2012-06-02 18:29:20','fallenid',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'3,22,0','See our website anzac.mdsnews.com for membership. Recruit status is trial only.'),(126,'The Royals - VRHC + 3RTR','Royals','A combined arms team consisting of a line infantry unit (VRHC) and a dedicated armour unit (3RTR).  Both units are based on historical WWII units and use real-world fire and manoeuvre tactics wherever possible.','','http://www.taskforceroyals.com',1,1,0,'2001-06-06 11:43:47','2012-06-11 03:41:40',1955,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Task Force Royals\nNEMO ME IMPUNE LACESSIT\nRide the  Walrus!\n\nTeamspeak:  66.28.224.196:8767\n',7,'2012-06-10 15:41:40','varbetim',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2,14,5',NULL),(360,'Black Knight Brigade','BKB','Welcome to the Allied only squad Black Knights Brigade (BKB).\n\nYou are required to install and use TEAMSPEAK for VoiceComms.\n\nPlaying AXIS or Failure to use TEAMSPEAK or play with your squad members may result in your REMOVAL from the squad','','http://www.bkbhq.com',1,1,0,'2001-06-07 14:12:33','2012-06-05 06:12:07',24504,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to BKB an Allied only Squad. \nTONGS YA BASS! \nAlot of BKBers have decided to mergwe with AEF - Allied Expedtion Force, if you are interrested in joining contact any of the recruiters in AEF. We will initially try this for 1 map and see how it goes, this new squad is huge :), you are welcome to come run with us, S! /Maxios\n\nMake Sure to Download TeamSpeak 3\n\nPlease Register at www.bkbhq.com',7,'2012-06-04 18:12:07','domestos',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0','BKB are an A L L I E D  ONLY squad... join us, have fun.... lots of beer !'),(955,'Das Leib Husaren Regiment Nr.1','tot','Description: In 1740 a right facing jawless deaths head with the skull in the forefront and the bones in the rear adorned the funeral drapings of Prussian King Frederick William I. To further his memory the Leib-Husaren Regiments 1-2 were formed','','http://www.1tot.com',1,1,0,'2001-06-15 20:34:54','2012-06-10 00:11:00',246220,0,0,0,0,0,'Members. Please email me @ oswaldboelcke@yahoo.com so that I may get your addresses please for future communiques. \n\n TS3 info 66.28.224.195:8768 password: 17x12 Join the ToT channel. tune ingame radio to CH 43 1 LB for COOP missions.',7,'2012-06-09 12:11:00','janikg53',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,14,23',NULL),(1080,'1st Attack Commando Group','1stacg','1st Atack Commando Group, Special Ops.','','http://1acg.tecllc.com',1,0,0,'2001-06-16 06:52:23','2011-11-06 18:36:21',10863,0,0,0,0,0,'All alone again, can\'t wait to get back on the road again.  ',7,'2011-05-22 16:14:29','ace4300',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(1191,'644th Wild Boar Division','644thWB','Multi-purpose squad - Land, Air, and Sea.','','http://www.644thwildboars.com',1,0,0,'2001-06-16 21:33:41','2012-05-16 11:40:01',295429,0,0,0,0,0,'CRS AXIS TS3 SERVER:\nTEAMSPEAK ADDRESS IS: 66.28.224.195:8768\n PASSWORD: 17x12',7,'2012-05-15 23:40:01','pooch',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'5,0,0',NULL),(1729,'1st.ROF =NETHERLANDS=','1stROF','1st Royal Orange Flames\n\"Niet praten maar doen!\"\nDutch (Nederlands) based squad, started in 1996 (WARBIRDS). \nWWIIOnline squad since 2001.\n\nFor more information visit www.1strof.com\n','','http://www.1strof.com',1,1,0,'2001-06-24 04:40:07','2011-08-14 04:56:55',15857,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the 1st. Royal Orange Flames (1st.ROF) \nThe 1st.ROF was formed as the first Dutch squadron in Warbirds in november 1997 by lapwin and zepher. \n\nNew members please goto www.1strof.com and subscribe to our forum, there you can introduce yourself.\nThe squad officers wil then make you an official member of the 1st.ROF\n\nSoon we will launch our Teamspeak server, chk our board for details\n\n',7,'2011-08-13 16:56:55','chlad',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(1753,'1st Fallschirmjager Regiment','1stFJ','An elite highly-mobile, combined-arms force modeled after the ground forces and paratroop units of the Luftwaffe. We focus on blitzkrieg actions involving deep penetration, combined arms tactics. Strategic objective defense and capture is our specialty.','','http://',1,0,0,'2001-06-24 15:22:14','2012-01-09 00:52:17',240619,0,0,0,0,0,'NOTE:: We are an Axis Squad --  New or returning member of the squad, make sure you go to www.1stFJ.com, register for the forums and get your TeamSpeak set up. To download TS, go to www.goteamspeak.com. \nTeamspeak server IP is 66.28.224.196:8768 ,  register on teamspeak ,  Make sure your tags say 1stFJ -  Name',7,'2012-01-08 10:52:17','pruplle',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(2186,'3rd Panzergruppe','3PzG','3rd Panzergruppe is a day one powerhouse voted 3 times the most valuable squad in the game. Made up of players from all over the world, 3PzG is a late night Axis squad. http://3pzg.clangrid.com ','','http://3pzg.clangrid.com',1,1,0,'2001-07-03 16:20:18','2012-06-06 08:38:52',357439,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome Back 3PzG Soldats! A few of us have returned for the new patch and mini-campaign and I want to invite you all on to the new 3PzG TS3 server @ ts24.gameservers.com:9142. The password is panzer. \n\nS! Peepers\n\n',7,'2012-06-05 20:38:52','simhooo',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'6,21,9','Battleground Europe\'s largest all gay Japanese squad. Don\'t ask don\'t tell'),(2369,'7.Infanterie Division','7ID','German speaking only \n\nwir sind da und waren nie weg\n\n\nwichtige Kanäle im Spiel:\nch 10      Heer\nch 20      Luftwaffe\nch 30      Kriegsmarine\nch side   OKW\nch 83      Faktory def.\nch 57      deutscher Spielerchat\nch 69      RDP Bomben','','http://www.7idgaming.de',1,1,0,'2001-07-09 14:54:17','2012-06-08 03:38:06',52455,3,0,0,0,0,'Unser Forum: \nwww.7idgaming.de -  bitte mit Ingame Namen anmelden!\n7.ID nutzt TS3  IP: 46.4.65.153:9988 PW: keins  \nSeitenwechsel nur waehrend der Intermission oder nach Absprache im Forum bitte. Ansonsten führt wiederholtes Spielen auf Alliierter Seite zum Squadausschluss.',7,'2012-06-07 15:38:06','oranje',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'5,19,0','Die 7.ID ist eines der ältesten deutschen Squads -  german speaking mainly'),(3467,'Osasto Lagus','lagus','Osasto Lagus (Detachment Lagus) was the first and only Finnish unit involving all the elements of infantry and armor warfare. Finally put together in the summer 1941 and it was named after the creator and commander JaegerColonel Ernst Ruben Lagus.','','http://www.lagus.org',1,0,0,'2001-08-14 10:12:36','2012-06-08 04:48:05',11952,0,0,0,0,0,'!! LAGUS.CC - Keskustelu/Forum - Ei ole mitään tietoa .org domainin paluusta. Forum ja sen postit on suurella todennäköisyydellä bitti taivaassa. Sivuston koodaaminen on vielä vaiheessa.\n\nMikälisikäli saadaan .org takaisin niin .cc forum voidaan siirtää helposti.\n\nKäykää rekisteröitymässä ainakin.\n\n- iPerkele / Lagus XO\n\n',7,'2012-04-15 19:02:36','wolfrez',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(3533,'Gefechtsverband Kuhlmey','kuhlmey','The Luftwaffe Detachment Kuhlmey (parts of I./SG3, I./SG5, II./JG54 and NAGr.1), named after their famous commander, Oberst Kurt Kuhlmey, helped in a remarkable way in heavy defense battles in Carelia, Finland during the summer 1944.','','kuhlmey.wwiionline.org',1,0,0,'2001-08-20 06:09:10','2011-02-06 05:14:46',387995,0,0,0,0,0,'Otetaanpa Stukat naftaliinista ja aloitetaan verikekkerit jällein kerran vuosien tauon jäkeen !!',7,'2008-02-02 15:30:44','kouhia',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,20,2',NULL),(3574,'91st Sturmbattalion- KG1 of 17 ID/XVIII/','91st','The 91st Sturmbattalion has a constant 24 hour online presence.  We  are made up of many nations.\nPeak hours are 6:00am to 12:00pm EDT (GMT-5). We are OKW integrated as KG1, 17 Infanterie Divsion, XVIII Korps, 12th Armee\n ','','http://www.91stsb.com',1,1,0,'2001-08-24 09:31:43','2012-07-06 02:15:34',227662,0,0,0,0,0,'All 91st Members are reminded we are a AXIS ONLY Squad and Team Speak 3 is a requirement for ALL members .  TS server = 66.28.224.195:8768 pass= 17x12  New recruits must Enlist at www.91stsb.com within 7 days of joining the squad. 91st plays as a TEAM - Please join us! All are welcome!',7,'2012-07-05 14:15:34','nobipure',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'6,14,18','If you are not committed and  not a team player don\'t bother'),(3852,'312 (Czechoslovak) Squadron RAF ~CHQ~','312raf','','','312raf.wwiionline.org',1,1,0,'2001-09-10 04:19:37','2010-02-09 05:06:47',11970,0,0,0,0,0,'Squad members of Recruiter and above can change the Squad MOTD via the Squad Tab.\nSquad Leaders can enable or disable squad voting: /voting on|off\nIf your Squad Leader is inactive you can elect a new leader: /voteco callsign\nTo invite a new player to the squad: /recruit callsign',7,'2010-02-08 15:06:47','pedrocz',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(4134,'US 2nd Armored Division, \"Hell on Wheels','us2ad','United States 2nd Armored Division\n\n\nA small squad of players devoted to simply having fun and working together, founded by some jackass old-school gamers from the very beginnings of WWIIOL (and before).','','http://www.us2ad.com',1,1,0,'2001-10-01 14:49:07','2012-06-04 06:12:43',349241,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s rebuild this squad - please be selective in your recruiting - we need people who will grovel at unslim\'s feet.',7,'2012-06-03 18:12:43','spear',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'4,0,0','US2AD is rebuilding.  Join.'),(4193,'7th Army Allied Strike Team','7thAST','7th AST is a combined arms squad.  Our primary goal is to work as a group, and have fun doing so.  whoyah!!','','http://www.7tharmy.us',1,1,0,'2001-10-06 04:48:31','2012-06-11 06:00:54',126026,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to World War II Online, and the squad 7th AST - We are on teamspeak 3 - Server Info : 66.28.224.195:8767 Password = huv36\nwe play ALLIED during the campaigns-\nOur Squad webpage is http://www.7tharmy.us\n** Get involved with the group - chat on the squad channel - try to work as a collective whole on a common target -b2k\n\n',7,'2012-06-10 18:00:54','noraa',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'5,17,1',''),(4286,'Jagdgeschwader 53 \"Pik As\"','Jg53','Welcome to Jagdgeschwader 53 \n\nFly With Us and Never Fly Alone!!\n \nVisit us at www.jg53.com','','http://www.jg53.com',1,0,0,'2001-10-13 02:31:53','2011-12-29 13:05:17',412411,0,0,0,0,0,'the JG53 webb site is back up at www.jg53.com  the  Ts server is also back up. ',7,'2011-08-07 20:31:04','galland',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,20,6',NULL),(5593,'Damned Forces Group','KgDamned','WWII Online Squadron of the Damned Air Group. The Damned\'s creed is Fair Play, Honor and Loyalty. We don\'t take ourselves too seriously though. Strict rules or a military chain of command aren\'t our style. We enjoy teamwork and helping others.','','kgdamned.wwiionline.org',1,1,0,'2002-02-13 17:22:56','2007-04-20 03:12:34',10086,0,0,0,0,0,'Squad members of Recruiter and above can change the Squad MOTD via the Squad Tab.\nSquad Leaders can enable or disable squad voting: /voting on|off\nIf your Squad Leader is inactive you can elect a new leader: /voteco callsign\nTo invite a new player to the squad: /recruit callsign\n\n\nDamned ATC  <S> to all',7,NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(5970,'*** SHADOW SQUAD ***','shadows','JUST HERE TO HAVE FUN\nwww.theshadowsquad.com/forum/index.php','','http://www.theshadowsquad.com',1,0,0,'2002-03-09 23:35:38','2012-03-02 09:51:12',682379,0,0,0,0,0,'Just Have Fun',7,'2011-07-25 23:46:23','mach30',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'6,17,0','\nALLIED SQUAD ONLY TO JOIN YOU MAY NOT PLAY AXIS !!!!'),(6212,'The Dirty Dozen','DDz','The Dirty Dozenz is an International Squad based in the North American Time Zones. We have players from the United States, Canada and more.\n\n\nPease Register at our forums: http://www.iamddz.org\n','','http://www.iamddz.org',1,0,0,'2002-04-03 04:42:26','2012-05-25 22:30:44',578372,0,0,0,0,0,'BlitzKader TeamSpeak 3: los01.bargainvoice.com:7185 / pass fsjr\nWeb: www.iamddz.org\n axis ts: 66.28.224.195  8768  17x12\n we r an axis only sqd',7,'2012-05-25 10:30:44','gilb',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'6,19,-8','The Dirty Dozenz - Kicking Allied  Ass Since 2001'),(6311,'Dog Company: \"Keep Buggering On\"','DogCo','Dog Company - AIR/NAVAL/GROUND Man\'s best friend can be found everywhere.  We are an elite group of players from all walks of life whom enjoy playing all aspects of the game. Our Area of Operation is primarily in the Zeeland Islands.','','http://www.ww2dogs.com',1,1,0,'2002-04-17 08:48:42','2012-06-03 08:45:56',662026,0,0,0,0,0,'register on the DOG forums www2dogs.com\n\nallied TS3  66.28.224.195:8767\npassword huv36\n\n',7,'2012-06-02 20:45:56','ohm',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'3,12,21','NO profanity allowed with this small group of veteran players.'),(6888,'3rd Canadian Division','3CD','The 3rd Canadian Division(-) is proud member of the  2nd Armored Brigade.   We are a dedicated squad full of experienced troops and leaders. So welcome to our humble squad and hope you\'ll be with us to enjoy your experience of this game. S!','','http://www.thewaterrats.com',1,1,0,'2002-07-05 17:51:22','2012-04-28 21:03:56',576872,0,0,0,0,0,'Ventrillo Server : tungsten.typefrag.com:11509\nTeamSpeak 3 Server : 66.28.224.195:8767      Server Pwd huv36\nwww.thewaterrats.com\n \nWe are teaming up with 4Wing.  Get onto TS and join 4Wing channels.  Squidrd is the 4Wing CO.  They are expecting us to help them out.  They are going to help ',7,'2012-04-28 09:03:56','bruzooka',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'6,19,-5',NULL),(7036,'\" Brotherhood of the Ironfist \"','IronFist','We fight together, we accept the fortunes of war together. Victory through teamwork.','','http:///www.getphpbb.com/phpbb/index.php?mforum=ironfist',1,0,0,'2002-07-28 23:12:24','2011-04-10 21:18:48',714185,0,0,0,0,0,'IRONFIST  - Work together whenever possible- we are at our best when co-operating. ',7,'2011-04-10 09:07:26','aagriff',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(7191,'The Iron Brotherhood','TIB','www.tib.somethingquiteodd.com','','http://www.tib.somethingquiteodd.com',1,1,0,'2002-08-16 13:16:14','2012-03-23 10:03:34',311129,0,0,0,0,0,'\n\n',7,'2012-03-22 22:03:34','sirbenny',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0','contact  me by . typing in the chat window  .m bigguz <message> and  say hello!'),(7658,'\"250 Hispana\"','250h','La \"250 Hispana\" esta integrada en la 16.Infanterie division (mot.), es una Division del XXVII armeekorps del German High Command (OKW). El KG1 de esta division esta formado por la \"250 Hispana\", una squad de habla hispana.','','http://www.250-hispana.com',1,1,0,'2002-11-20 01:59:02','2012-06-04 05:52:23',106984,4,0,0,0,0,'CAMPAÑA 82 ACTIVA!!!!\nEl festival de plomo ha dado comienzo.\n',7,'2012-06-03 17:52:23','oberts',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'5,21,1','La squad hispana mas grande y disciplinada, UNETE!'),(7798,'11th Hussars','hussars','11th Hussars: hitting the AXIS in the nuts since 2002! Players from around the world.  New and Old experience and peoples of all types.\n  Ventrillo IP: 75.126.228.240  Port: 5570  PW: by request.','','http://www.hussars.s4.bizhat.com',1,1,0,'2002-12-22 10:49:23','2012-06-07 03:05:23',788146,0,0,0,0,0,'No axis playing. \nTS3  IP 66.28.224.195:8767\nPassword  huv36\n',7,'2012-06-06 15:05:23','buffa',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,18,0','going on 5 yrs this Aug 09!  And still loving  this game! :D'),(7827,'1st Lithuanian Brigade \"Iron Wolves\"','1LB','A combined-arms squad of veteran players.  If you enjoy FUN and TEAMWORK, this is the squad for you.  New players are always welcome!  We are happy to show each new member the skills to make their game play effective and rewarding.','','http://www.the-iron-wolves.com',1,0,0,'2002-12-30 00:34:20','2012-05-27 06:32:42',424939,0,0,0,0,0,'\"wibble-wibble\" - yep that about sums it up!\n',7,'2012-04-22 10:00:25','pulledpo',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'6,21,0','The iron Wolves  www.the-iron-wolves.com   channel 43 Join the  best.'),(7951,'The Haze','TheHaze','Primarily a WarBirds III squad, we\'re seeing how the other half lives.','','thehaze.wwiionline.org',1,1,0,'2003-01-27 00:47:03','2008-04-06 08:20:35',28025,0,0,0,0,0,'\n\nSquad Leaders can enable or disable squad voting: /voting on|off\nIf your Squad Leader is inactive you can elect a new leader: /voteco callsign\nTo invite a new player to the squad: /recruit callsign',7,NULL,NULL,