3,0,0,0,0,0,'Push West!!\n\nVoice comms on Axis TS3 server\n\n66.28.224.195:8768\npw 17X12 ',7,'2011-09-28 21:40:20','jsilec',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'3,21,-1',NULL),(8452,'1st Air Commando Group (1ACG)','66CDO','Made up of old Warbirds vets who\'ve come over to WWIIOL. We\'re primarily infantry, but being old pilots, will probably spend some time in aircraft, as well. Tanks are not out of the question, either.','','http://www.66commando.com',1,1,0,'2003-06-09 09:51:43','2012-04-30 09:49:33',859494,0,0,0,0,0,'1st Air Commando Group\nBigmo has TS server up!\n1. Download TS3\n2. IP: 64.237.62.226:9123\n3. PW: fender\n\nWe should all email each other when we know we\'re going to be on the game. Mine is: Wes@AerialGunner.com\n',7,'2012-02-12 09:53:14','stoley',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(8862,'22nd Mechanized Infantry Regiment','22ndMech','22nd Mech has been around for Seven years now. We are all about teamwork, training and helping out our new guys, all while having fun!\n\n We offer basic training course to each new member. Our average age is 25+ and we only play allied! www.22ndmech.org','','http://22ndmech.forumotion.net',1,1,0,'2003-10-29 20:32:18','2012-04-29 23:42:45',782726,0,0,0,0,0,'Pls Note guys , whilst in Campaign , we should all be playing allied. Recruits are free to play both sides for the first 2 weeks. After that you need to decide to play allied and stay here, or play axis and leave the squad.\n\n\nLets try and get a few more people using Teamspeak. 66.28.224.195:8767 pass is huv36 , and we have our own squad channel on allied server.\n\n',7,'2012-04-29 11:42:45','k1ng',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'6,18,0','22nd Mech - Always outnumbered, never outgunned!'),(8977,'Stosstrupp Gold','stgold','The one and only german speaking allied squad !\n\nDie einzige deutschsprachige Allied Squad !','','http://www.wwiionline.de -> stosstrupp gold ',1,0,0,'2003-12-08 15:43:15','2012-02-04 02:59:21',31033,3,0,0,0,0,'BITTE ALLE DEN SQUAD CHANNEL EINSCHALTEN! BESSER: INS TS KOMMEN !!!!!\n\nINF GUIDE Update im Internen eingefügt :)\n\nBitte beim Spielen auch den TeamSpeak 3 benutzen !!!\nTS - IP:   ts.primacom.net:9997   PW: wwiionline\nDownload unter www.teamspeak.com\n\nFür unser Internes Forum auf www.wwiionline.de müsst Ihr euren Zugang neu \"beantragen\". Dafür bitte Ins Forum einloggen -> Kontro',7,'2012-02-03 12:59:21','kawumm',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1,0,0',NULL),(9091,'617 Squadron \"The DamBusters\"','617DB','Tasked with long range bombing of Axis factories and close air support for ground troops. Yea gents lets kick some booty!!','','http://617dambusters.com',1,0,0,'2004-01-06 13:10:52','2012-05-26 11:10:36',698542,0,0,0,0,0,'Ok...I guess its only Axis during intermission and back to the Allies for Campaign 82! Lets bomb some factories.',7,'2012-05-25 23:10:36','eigenman',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,12,-5','RDP factory Bombing squad. Always looking for Escorts and DB7/Havoc Pilots'),(9097,'The Four Horsemen','403rd','Welcome to The Four Horsemen','','403rd.wwiionline.org',1,1,0,'2004-01-08 18:06:45','2007-04-20 03:12:34',24147,0,0,0,0,0,'Squad members of Recruiter and above can change the Squad MOTD via the Squad Tab.\nSquad Leaders can enable or disable squad voting: /voting on|off\nIf your Squad Leader is inactive you can elect a new leader: /voteco callsign\nTo invite a new player to the squad: /recruit callsign',7,NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(9266,'4 Wing Squadrons','4Wing','Coming from Aces High and Airwarrior, we\'ve arrived in WWIIOL ready to make our mark.\n\nMany times you hear people call out   109 my 6   HEEEELP!!!!!! \n(this is noobish)\n\nAdd this info and u will \n\nHere is how we do it:\n1. Location\n2. Altitude\n3. Direction','','http://4wingonline.com',1,1,0,'2004-03-13 02:10:16','2012-06-10 12:09:40',13479,0,0,0,0,0,'Team Speak  (TS3) IP is 66.28.224.195:8767\nPASSWORD: huv36\nIf you need a sig or forum access please send me a email. prelly@bresnan.net \n\nwww.4wingonline.com\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n',7,'2012-06-10 00:09:40','rogue187',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'6,0,0',NULL),(9425,'1st Czechoslovak Infantry Battalion','1stcsib','Universal Czech and Slovak ground unit.\r\nUniverzalni ceska a slovenska pozemni jednotka.\r\n\r\n','','http://forum.virtualfighters.cz/index.php?c=3',1,1,0,'2004-05-16 09:48:20','2011-02-04 05:34:46',960450,0,0,0,0,0,'Bijme fasisty! Na vecne casy a nikdy jinak!',7,'2010-10-16 12:10:54','vitycz31',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,20,1',NULL),(9544,'Phew\'s Pirate Battle Group','PPBG','We are Phew\'s Pirate Battle Group (PPBG); named for a great player and friend no longer with us.  We fight hard and have fun, just the way Phew wanted us to.  S!  & we\'ll see you on the battlefield','','http://None at this Time',1,1,0,'2004-07-03 09:30:09','2011-04-04 09:09:00',270274,0,0,0,0,0,'** PP\n  PPBG members are located in the RatPack Squad. Pls look us up and join us. Once PPBG Always PPBG!',7,'2011-04-03 21:09:00','victhest',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'5,18,22','Come join the fun. Pirates is where it\'s at!!! Have you kiilled your grey today?'),(9664,'1775th Rapid Deployment Force','1775RDF','We are an elite force ready to rapidly deploy wherever assistance is needed. We cover the entire map on land, sea and in the air. We allow Allied play but only if you post in our forums first to let us know!','','http://www.1775rdf.com',1,1,0,'2004-08-23 21:50:21','2012-06-01 14:40:59',491332,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the 1775th our new forums are located at www.1775rdf.com/squadforum please register when you can, use your ingame name. New TS Ip address is 70.32.46.162 port:2409 If you are having any problems with\n.r TS please ask one of the XO\'s or ask Recruiters for assistance and or the new password. This is a new TS 3 Server.  S!  NOW GO GET SOME FFS!!\n\n\nMattwitt is going allied for a few maps..',7,'2012-06-01 02:40:59','sshadow',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'6,21,0','welcome to the 1775th\nplease register www.1775rdf.com\n'),(9749,'Lafayette Federation','Lafayett','LAF has existed since before the game. We believe in team before self and hold to the ethos of Tradition, Pride, Excellence. Generally you will find us in the Dirty South fighting alongside 1st Inf Regt/Brigade. Learn more at www.lafayettefederation.org','','http://www.LafayetteFederation.org',1,0,0,'2004-10-07 19:48:00','2011-11-19 16:02:34',106501,0,0,0,0,0,'Great time to recruit new members and bring back old members! Don\'t forget to have them sign up for the forums at www.lafayettefederation.org. S!\n',7,'2011-11-19 02:02:34','bomb73',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'6,20,-5',NULL),(9970,'3rd Commandos Brigade','3cb','TIP OF THE SWORD!\r\n99.9% Need Not Apply.\r\nDo you have the right stuff?\n\nWe are an Allied Only Squad, and  Do not play Axis during a live campaign.','','http://www.3commandos.com',1,0,0,'2005-02-08 16:51:38','2011-11-15 07:01:47',983331,0,0,0,0,0,'Attention 3rd Commando\'s!\n\nWhere are my Commando\'s?  Get on TS and talk to me.  Lets do some ops together.   Bandit4\n',7,'2011-09-28 20:18:02','revskip',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,8,0','Make a DIFFERENCE, Be apart of a TEAM, Join the 3CB TODAY!'),(10048,'The Jewish Brigade','Jews','The year was 1941. War raged across Europe and North Africa. Eager to face the Germans in battle, Jews in the British Empire sought, and were given permission, to form a fighting force. Thus began the legend of the Jewish Brigade...','','jbde.wwiionline.org',1,1,0,'2005-03-27 02:11:25','2009-11-29 01:24:47',340922,0,0,0,0,0,'Message from ViFF, CO of the Jewish Brigade:\nTune text radio F5 to Channel 23. Create all Air Missions in 75 Sqn, RAF. \n(IF ANYONE FROM THE SQUAD IS STILL ACTIVE PLEASE NOTIFY XCOM)\n',7,'2005-11-27 17:05:40','phantome',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(10077,'1st Rat Pack, Special Op\'s','RatPack','we now need TS3 \nWe have a Squad Team Speak Server\naddress is  ts9.teamspeak.cc:9034- PW is ratpack\nsend me an email  with you game name dilbert11@rochester.rr.com\nHappy Birthday Dilbert!!!!!\n\n\n','','http://www.packrat.com',1,1,0,'2005-04-15 23:10:01','2012-06-12 00:19:08',23477,0,0,0,0,0,'Team Speak info is located under squads/description If ya can\'t figure it out ASK!\nWe\'ll be glad to help plus TS adds a whole new dimension to the game, so get it up and running now!    \n',7,'2012-06-11 12:19:08','albert92',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'4,20,-1','Looking for an Allied squad that  enjoys the game?  Join the RatPack!\n'),(10092,'Panzer Division Großdeutschland','PdGd','Mostly Tank only squad dedicated to players who love to tank\n\n\nWe also recruit Grenediers who will work in combined arms to help advance the Panzer offensive','','pd-gd.wwiionline.org',1,1,0,'2005-04-25 22:02:45','2011-07-29 08:26:40',889130,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Panzer Division Grossdeutschland\n WWIIOL\'s premier Tank Squad....',7,'2011-07-28 20:26:40','gabrielt',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(10128,'The Elite Fighting Force','Elite','The Elite Fighting Force is a Squad of Highly trained soldiers that can be called on to do what we do best and that is to take the enemy out! Either Land, Air or Sea we are The Elite and we get the job done!!!','','http://www.TheEliteFightingForce.com',1,1,0,'2005-05-23 11:31:31','2011-06-23 05:12:55',241391,0,0,0,0,0,'The forums are open! Come visit....\nhttp://p219.ezboard.com/bchpsmacktalkboard\n\nWelcome to the Elite Fighting Force!\n\n',7,'2011-06-22 17:12:55','osufan1',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(10147,'The Band','band','a group of brothers fighting together. real brothers and anyone who we can call brothers\n\n\n\n','','band.wwiionline.org',1,1,0,'2005-06-14 07:00:57','2012-04-25 11:16:05',756706,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the Band of Brothers Squad.\nWe will be playing French/British this coming map. \nWe have a number of 10 year veterans in the squad.\nWe are glad to answer any questions you may have.\nNEW TeamSpeak3 for Allied\'Axis players. \nAllied TS Channel is now 1st Motorized Infantry Division\nTS Address is 66.28.224.195:8767 Allies Password: huv36\n66.28.224.196.8768 Axis Password: 17x12',7,'2011-12-28 19:49:24','n8thegr8',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,9,-5',NULL),(10150,'101st Airborne Screaming Eagles','101stabn','We conduct Airborne operations as an organized unit, implementing a rank structure and real life tactics in order to achieve success on the virtual battlefield.  We use teamspeak, new and old players welcome.  17 and older only.\n','','http://www.oldabe.net',1,1,0,'2005-06-15 19:14:33','2012-06-11 13:33:34',928584,0,0,0,0,0,'S! and welcome to the 101st Airborne. All new recruits must register at www.oldabe.net or you will be removed from the squad.  When you register please use your game name so we can approve you.  Visit the forums for updates and events. Squad nights are every Tuesday at 8:00pm EDT (GMT-4). Squad Trainings are held Sundays at 1:00pm EDT (GMT-4).\nS!\nShad0w64- CO\n\nThanks for logging in!  Lets have FUN',7,'2012-06-11 01:33:34','hellkaat',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2,1,0','Join the 101st ABN Screaming Eagles!!! Sign up on www.oldabe.net  17y/o + only'),(10225,'169th WAR DOGS','169th','We are a mature group of players that specialize in doing what can\'t be done.\r\nWhen the orders are issued we get the tough jobs as they know we will adapt and overcome!\r\nWe have  Armor,Infantry,and Air wings all working together to accomplish one goal.','','169th.wwiionline.org',1,1,0,'2005-09-06 19:44:26','2010-01-25 09:53:24',722124,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the squad.  If you don\'t have Teamspeak you don\'t have SQUAT!!!!!!!!! Talk beats type every time. The AXIS have TS, so should you. Go to http://allied.wwiiol.net  and  register  DO IT NOW!!!!!  Ask squadmates for help if you need it. Salute!',7,'2010-01-24 19:53:24','canucky',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0','We love killin us some jerry\'s!\n And having our way with thier ho\'s'),(10236,'Raboche-Krest\'yanskaya Krasnaya Armiya','rkka','Raboche-Krest\'yanskaya Krasnaya Armiya','','http://www.wwiionline.ru',1,0,0,'2005-09-21 13:11:42','2012-03-17 04:57:57',934820,0,0,0,0,0,'рWe playing on Axis side!',7,'2012-03-16 16:57:57','fantik7',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0','Dobro  pozhalovat\'  v  SQUAD  russkoyazichnyh igrokov  RKKA!'),(10264,'(SOL) Navy','SolNavy','The name (SOL) Navy instills fear in our enemies and wary respect in our allies. We are a tightly knit group of soldiers that never leaves any of its members or allies behind.','','http://www.solnavy.com',1,0,0,'2005-12-13 20:08:01','2009-05-30 07:52:19',3550,0,0,0,0,0,'(SOL) Navy is in temporary action again, if you want an invite send pyldrvr a message for invite.',7,'2007-09-22 18:39:29','ebil',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(10367,'JackBoot','jackboot','Our Creedo is \"Their Necks.. Our Boots\"\n\npreferably  French necks.\n','','http://zombo.com',1,1,0,'2006-11-26 16:21:41','2010-06-07 11:01:39',3094,0,0,0,0,0,'Their Necks, Our Boots...',7,'2008-01-21 20:58:38','falgstav',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(10384,'Jagdgeschwader 2 Richthofen','JG_2','JG2 is one of the oldest Luftwaffe squadrons in WWIIOL community.\n Being a strong influence throughout WWIIOL.\nWe Pride ourselves on our dedication to Team work & Communication.\nWork as a team & \"We\" Will be successful Everytime.\n\nS! Gents \nFrom JG2','','http://www.thejg2.net',1,1,0,'2007-01-06 14:20:50','2012-04-15 23:16:03',83109,0,0,0,0,0,'TS3-Primary- 66.28.224.195:8768- PW 17x12\nTS3 for JG51 jg51.penguinscanfly.net:6148  PW molders\nregister here for team/forums  http://www.thejg2.net/html/register.asp\nSee www.worldofplanesgame.com\n\n',7,'2012-04-15 11:16:03','donzi',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,12,-4',NULL),(10420,'13th Infantry Regiment','13th','No Axis Playing (except during intermission)\nRegister @ www.13inf.com (for full squad membership)\n\nTeamSpeak 3: 66.28.224.195:8767  password is huv36  \nName should begin <13INF> followed by your ingame nickname\n\nExample: \"<13INF> Lucky\"\n\n','','http://13inf.com/forum',1,1,0,'2007-05-19 14:58:27','2012-06-11 07:24:21',1170247,0,0,0,0,0,'barbed22 IS now acting CO of the 13th untill i return\nWelcome to the 13th Inf. Please register at www.13inf.com/forum    \nTeamSpeak is free and found at www.teamspeak.com. Top right Downloads/ TeamSpeak 3 you want  client. Address is; 66.28.224.195:8767  Password huv36\n\nThree Rules\n1. Playing AXIS is verboten\n2. When In doubt see rule 1\n3. Pat is a grumpy wanker... let him be!',7,'2012-06-10 19:24:21','mortis45',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0','Adult squad who\'ll show you the right way (whilst taking the p*ss!)...'),(10427,'85th Fallschirmjager Regiment','FF','|www.flyingfall.com|\nOur squad is Based upon the 85th Fallschirmjager Regiment.  During WWII they were the elite of the elite Regiments. That is what our squad is aiming to become.  Nickname: Flying Fallschimjager. Squad Ops: Thursday-Sunday.','','http://www.flyingfall.com',1,1,0,'2007-06-08 23:57:25','2012-06-11 12:18:47',1161947,0,0,0,0,0,'**ATTENTION** \nThere has been a large issue lately with cooperation between squaddies. This needs to change! We are all apart of this great squad to work together and be effective. If an Officer needs your assistance be sure to assist if possible. ALSO make sure to keep chatter to Battle Comms when neccessary.\n*Either way FF is awsome! \nTEAMSPEAK IS A REQUIREMENT!\nFOR THE AXIS TEAMSPEAK\nHostname/I',7,'2012-06-11 00:18:47','terrtim',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'5,6,0',NULL),(10439,'Secret Off Topic','sot','Going against SOT Squad is like spending an hour with tubgirl and then trying to pop a boner bigger than a ninja that is porking hot chix has.  In other words, messy, like JD\'s pooper.','','http://www.secretot.com',1,1,0,'2007-09-01 12:34:04','2011-05-01 23:40:59',1166918,0,0,0,0,0,'IT TIME.  http://www.secretot.com\n',7,'2011-05-01 11:40:59','commodor',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'6,14,-4',NULL),(10472,'StatHo','statho','Under Destruction','','http://events.wwiionline.com/scripts/services/index.jsp',1,0,0,'2008-02-07 20:47:24','2011-11-13 21:59:23',28221,0,0,0,0,0,'1.34 is here!',7,'2009-11-20 18:49:23','scorp',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'3,1,6','It ain\'t easy being a Ho'),(10530,'Allied Forces','AllFor','Our squadwebsite provided by Dubane is: www.dubanesuckscock.com.\nAllies ONLY squad, Please do not join AXIS for any reason or you will be fucked.\nPass the sheep to Mitch plz....... <--- Off to speedwanking\n','','http://www.allforsquad.com/',1,1,0,'2008-09-19 17:10:26','2012-06-11 03:42:34',1086097,0,0,0,0,0,'ALLIED ONLY SQUAD!\nNew website up and running allforsquad.com\noh! and make sure you sign up to our new forum at www.allforsquad.com/forum/forum.php\n\nOur new super secure TS3 server is - provided by His Royal Dubbyness:Allfor.clanvent.com:4461 \nIP 159.253.131.50:4461 PASSWORD = bollox',7,'2012-06-10 15:42:34','booldose',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,19,0','Download Teamspeak.com and use it\n'),(10605,'CIGOGNES','Cigognes','Escadrille virtuelle regroupant des joueurs francophones interesses par le vol en premier mais aimant aussi jouer au sol regulierement.\n\nwww.cigognes.net','','http://www.cigognes.net',1,1,0,'2009-06-26 14:12:59','2012-06-10 03:35:42',45724,2,0,0,0,0,'SQUAD FRANCOPHONE\nFrenh speaking players\nBONJOUR a tous\n\n\nwww.cigognes.net\nteamspeak: 66.28.224.195:8767\nmumble : 94.23.211.61:15280 pass: normandie76',7,'2012-06-09 15:35:42','tigre07',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(10620,'Cornered Rat Software','CRS-RATS','Cornered Rat Software is a division of the Royal Scottish Highland Suicide Regiment.\n\n\nAnd proud of it!\n\n\nAaaaaahhhhhhhh........<splat>.','',NULL,1,0,0,'2009-08-13 12:18:16','2011-11-16 01:27:55',2004,0,0,0,0,0,NULL,7,'2011-11-15 11:27:55','gophur',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(10635,'1st Naval Support Squadron','1nss','Naval Support Squad, dedicated to the Zeeland\'s, and various riverlines.','','http://82ndxspecxops.11.forumer.com/index.php',1,1,0,'2009-11-19 19:37:29','2012-05-24 09:33:08',65156,0,0,0,0,0,'S! All. Remember to check our forum\'s, the link is above and right, be sure you are registered, Alright, I know it\'s been a while, but, the CO\'s and XO\'s should be getting more active shortly. If you have issues, or questions, fine me on our forums, or PM me in game, or on the game forums. That is all.',7,'2012-05-23 21:33:08','bockscar',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'6,0,0','like naval? need rank? join us! \n\n'),(10653,'1st SSF \"The Devil\'s Brigade\"','devils','Land, sea or air the 1st SSF take on missions that would cause most units to soil their breeches. Known to the Germans as \"The Black Devils\", they are the Black Sheep of the AEF with a well earned reputation of being outcasts and hooligans.','',NULL,1,1,0,'2010-01-16 02:20:31','2010-02-06 11:10:26',3724,0,0,0,0,0,'Anything worth fighting for, is worth fighting dirty for!\n',7,'2010-02-05 21:10:26','mikepoly',0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0','Land, Sea and Air we do it all. New players welcome!!'),(10661,'Blitz Kader','BlitzKader','Blitzkader was founded on March 1st, 2010 by a core group of players with years of WWIIOnline expertise.  \n\nBlitzkader is a 100% Axis squad that moves the map and breaks Allied hearts !','','http://www.blitzkader.com',1,1,0,'2010-03-01 22:00:05','2012-06-11 08:09:19',1000834,0,0,0,0,0,'|| BLITZ KADER MESSAGE(S) OF THE DAY ||\n\nAll recruits and RETURNING MEMBERS have 14 DAYS to post at the new recruit corner thread, or they will be removed from roster\nThe Command & Staff Welcomes Everyone to Blitzkader!\nBK TS3 server:  los01.bargainvoice.com:7185  PW: fsjr\nAxis TS3 server: 66.28.224.195:8768  PW: 17x12 ',7,'2012-06-10 20:09:19','warkillr',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'3,0,0',NULL),(10671,'Jagdgeschwader 26 \'Schlageter\'','JG26','JG26','','http://s7.invisionfree.com/JG26/index.php',1,1,0,'2010-04-01 05:42:26','2012-06-01 08:52:08',1073651,0,0,0,0,0,'TOM/KILLS that is all\n\njg26.instantts.com:4123',7,'2012-05-31 20:52:08','danihell',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(10776,'Screaming Weasels Boot Camp Squad','Weasels','\'Screaming Weasels\' is a squad where new players can learn the basics of WWIIOnline:Battleground Europe! Welcome to join in on the fun!','','http://www.battlegroundeurope.com',1,1,0,'2011-08-15 15:40:30','2012-06-11 06:14:40',1049614,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome Soldier\nPress F4 to type on squad chat\n\nGame Voice Comms (Download at: www.teamspeak.com)\nAllied: 66.28.224.195:8767 Password: huv36\nAxis: 66.28.224.195:8768 Password: 17x12\n\nGet involved with other squads to enhance your game experience. To leave this squad type \".leave\" and accept it. Use side channel to seek player created squads.',7,'2012-06-10 18:14:40','lonely',0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL),(10809,'Strafbattalion Ug','ug','how do i chat here??','',NULL,1,1,0,'2012-02-12 18:17:26','2012-02-13 08:19:47',3418,0,0,0,0,0,'TAKE THAT, MISTER CHURCHILL!',7,NULL,NULL,0,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0,0,0',NULL);
